(7492490, 1192950, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes to the challenge<br/> <br/>This was probably quite spectacular and impressive in the flesh, so to speak, though I think some of that has been lost in the image. Although your image features some of the impressiveness of the location I feel the symmetry you sought is not really evident from this composition. The partially hidden purple and red items within the lighting cobweb once seen become too dominant to be dismissed. Your exposure is good with good detail throughout. Whilst I am no fan of obvious garish Christmas decorations this is subtle to the extent that it doesnt really convey festivity it could easily be a permanent fixture. I am pleased that you have had some positive comments but its not quite hit the spot for me, sorry Jonathon.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes to the challenge This was probably quite spectacular and impressive in the flesh, so to speak, though I think some of that has been lost in the image. Although your image features some of the impressiveness of the location I feel the symmetry you sought is not really evident from this composition. The partially hidden purple and red items within the lighting cobweb once seen become too dominant to be dismissed. Your exposure is good with good detail throughout. Whilst I am no fan of obvious garish Christmas decorations this is subtle to the extent that it doesnt really convey festivity it could easily be a permanent fixture. I am pleased that you have had some positive comments but its not quite hit the spot for me, sorry Jonathon.', '2017-01-16 16:22:05.000000', NULL, 0),
